cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PyDTMC in your work, please cite this software."
type: software
title: PyDTMC
abstract: >-
  PyDTMC is a lightweight Python library focused on discrete-time Markov
  chains and hidden Markov models. It provides a comprehensive set of classes
  and functions for creating, manipulating, analyzing, simulating, and
  visualizing Markovian stochastic processes.
